            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which handler matches the failure from <code>int(\"none\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except TypeError:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except ValueError:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which handler matches the failure from <code>int(\"none\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except TypeError:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Both <code>except ValueError:</code> and <code>except TypeError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>except ValueError:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Complete the Value Handler",
            "id": 152092,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the handler for text that can't convert to an integer.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"entry.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entry = \" /><text value=\"&quot;none&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  amount = int(entry)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter a number&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Enter a number\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the handler for text that can't convert to an integer.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"entry.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entry = \" /><text value=\"&quot;none&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  amount = int(entry)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter a number&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"str\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Enter a number\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>int</code>, followed by <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Match Runtime Failures",
            "id": 152093,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operation and handler are correctly matched?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>data[\"missing\"] → TypeError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operation and handler are correctly matched?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>data[\"missing\"] → TypeError</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Both <code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code> and <code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Zero Handler",
            "id": 152094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the second handler for a guest count of <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"bill.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / guests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use numbers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ZeroDivisionError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Add a guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add a guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the second handler for a guest count of <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"bill.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / guests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use numbers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ZeroDivisionError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Add a guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add a guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>/</code>, followed by <code>ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep Specific Handlers First",
            "id": 152095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's true about this code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It keeps the tailored response reachable and the fallback last</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It keeps the tailored response reachable and adds the fallback first</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It keeps the tailored response reachable and has no fallback</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It keeps the tailored response reachable and the fallback last.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>These handlers follow a <code>try</code> block. If it raises <code>ValueError</code>, which messages print?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Only Invalid value.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Only Other failure.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Invalid value, then Other failure.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">No messages because a bare handler cannot follow a specific handler.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Only Invalid value.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch Missing Data",
            "id": 152096,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the second handler for the missing <code>\"role\"</code> key.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Try to read the missing field and handle the missing-key error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"role\"</code>, followed by <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Capture Error Details",
            "id": 152097,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Capture the conversion exception in the variable <code>error</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"price.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;free&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = float(price_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Price failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as details\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Price failed\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>as error</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Capture the conversion exception in the variable <code>error</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"price.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;free&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = float(price_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Price failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as details\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Price failed\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ValueError</code>, followed by <code>as error</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Display the Captured Message",
            "id": 152098,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Type the captured variable inside <code>print()</code> to display the exception message.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(quantity_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(error)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'many'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>error</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Label the Failed Step",
            "id": 152099,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a short label that identifies the failed rating conversion.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"rating.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rating_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;great&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  rating = int(rating_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rating:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", error)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Price:&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Order:&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rating: invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'great'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"Rating:\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display <code>Rating:</code> before the failed rating conversion details.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"rating.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rating_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;great&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  rating = int(rating_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rating:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", error)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Price:&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Order:&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rating: invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'great'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ValueError</code>, followed by <code>\"Rating:\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
