          {
            "title": "Choose the Narrow Handler",
            "id": 152100,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A dictionary read may request a missing key. Which is the narrowest useful handler?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except KeyError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except Exception:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except KeyError:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A dictionary read may request a missing key. Which is the narrowest useful handler?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except KeyError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except Exception:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Both <code>except KeyError:</code> and <code>except Exception:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>except KeyError:</code>.</p></body></html>"
